Source: lys-files
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Build-Depends:
 debhelper-compat (= 13),
 desktop-file-utils
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/stubbedev/lys/tree/main/files
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/stubbedev/lys.git
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/stubbedev/lys/tree/main/files

Package: lys-files
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 hicolor-icon-theme,
 shared-mime-info
Recommends:
 bubblewrap,
 dbus,
 libvulkan1,
 mesa-vulkan-drivers,
 udisks2
Provides: x-file-manager
Description: file manager for the lys desktop
 lys-files browses folders in tabs with previews and Quick Look, copies,
 moves, renames and trashes files with progress, conflicts and undo, shares
 them with other apps through the clipboard and drag and drop, and answers
 org.freedesktop.FileManager1, so "show in folder" from other apps opens it.
